=== ana: step 53880 of 53880 (100.000% of its plan) ===
## User

The arithmetic mean of a non-empty list of numbers.

## Type

type
```haskell
average :: [Double] -> Double
```

## Term

```haskell
average xs = sum xs / fromIntegral (length xs)
```

